      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Tôi không hiểu as your first sentence for \"I don't understand\". This is for when someone is speaking too quickly or using unfamiliar words. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a slower repeat, a pointed explanation, or a switch to writing. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
